; Scenario script example.
# Start
@back Beach
@char Kohaku.Happy pos:50 wait!
Kohaku: Hi! Welcome to {location}.[wait 1] Make yourself at home.
@choice "Thanks" goto:#Thanks
@choice "Leave" goto:#Leave if:canLeave
@stop

# Thanks
@set visited = visited + 1 ; count visits
@if visited > 1
    Kohaku: Back again?
@else
    Kohaku: Nice to meet you!
@goto #Start

# Leave
Kohaku.Sad: See you <b>soon</b>...<->
@goto #Start

----------------------------------------------------

